  "prefLabel": "Ins 4502.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 4502.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to set forth the procedures for filing and the required contents of the Corporate Governance Annual Disclosure (CGAD), deemed necessary by the commissioner to carry out the provisions of RSA 401-D.\n\nSource. #12596, eff 7-30-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins4500.html"
